    - target: {fileID: 5905881967701677635, guid: 3938ed1ae5c23814f8817ead1ed0d3bf, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Text
      value: "The behavior tree state can be saved allowing it to be restored at
        a later point in time. You have the option of saving to a file or getting
        the save data allowing you to save and restore the data using your own saving
        methods.\n\nIn this example the behavior tree data is saved along with some
        other data such as the Transform position and Animator state. This data is
        then saved to a JSON file allowing it to be restored later on.\n\nSee the
        documentation below for more information: \nhttps://opsive.com/support/documentation/behavior-designer-pro/save-load/"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
